   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "Ah!",
   "uk": "А!",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Shadow Kamoshida",
   "en": "Nngh...",
   "uk": "Нгх...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "What's wrong? Not running away?",
   "uk": "Що таке? Не тікаєш?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Why don't you run?",
   "uk": "Чого ж ти не біжиш?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Aren't you a great athlete?",
   "uk": "Ти ж видатний спортсмен?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Shadow Kamoshida",
   "en": "It's always been like this... all those[n]goddamn hyenas forcing their[n]expectations on me!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Shadow Kamoshida",
   "en": "I'm doing this all for them! What's wrong[n]about demanding a reward for that!?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "Now you're makin' excuses?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "We'll do something about that distorted[n]heart of yours.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Shadow Kamoshida",
   "en": "Hrrgh...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Scared?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Right now, you're seeing the same view[n]that Shiho did.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I'm sure she was scared too... except she[n]had no choice but to jump...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_5_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "What will you do?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_5_0#2",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Will you jump? Or would you rather[n]die here?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
